          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "On Friday, I was planning to take a motorcycle trip to Leshan over the weekend to feel the wind and break my routine.",
          "start_time": 1.152,
          "end_time": 8.831999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.776,
          "end_time": 19.776,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "周五的时候还打算周末摩托车去乐山逛逛，吹吹风，改变一下生活节奏。",
          "start_time": 1.152,
          "end_time": 8.831999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.776,
          "end_time": 19.776,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "But I gave up on that idea Friday night because I didn’t go to bed early or make any preparations.",
          "start_time": 8.831999999999999,
          "end_time": 14.712,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.776,
          "end_time": 19.776,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "但其实周五晚上就放弃了这个想法，因为没有早睡，没有做相关的准备。",
          "start_time": 8.831999999999999,
          "end_time": 14.712,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.776,
          "end_time": 19.776,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "I ended up sleeping in on Saturday and didn’t get up for lunch until 1 p.m.",
          "start_time": 14.712,
          "end_time": 19.776,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 19.776,
          "end_time": 19.776,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "周六也睡到很晚才醒，直到下午一点才起床吃午饭。",
          "start_time": 14.712,
          "end_time": 19.776,
          "language": "source"
